{
  "$comment": "Whole campaigns flown from a new campaign's first day (MVP Implementation Plan phase 17; MVP Scope 4.3; v0.2 Implementation Plan phase 6). Each career is a plan a player could follow: equip a fit - a representative fit from tests/fixtures/scenarios/progression.json, an authored reference fit (fit.*) or one of the career fits below - then fly a scenario until a goal is met: a number of completions, a number of losses, or enough credits for the next fit. A fit on another hull switches to a stored ship of that hull or buys one; reuse moves the modules it needs off the pilot's other ships first. A scenario is a progression or ladder scenario, one of the career scenarios below, or <fitId>@<encounterId>, a reference fit flown with its matrix policy (tests/fixtures/balance/matrix.json). ignoreModuleDrops leaves every module drop in the wrecks. maxSorties is the band: a career that needs more sorties than that stalls, and the stall is the finding. Nothing is set directly; every credit and item comes from the loop.",
